	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You gain the ability to cast the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.zhtyft34531a9nil]{Haste} spell once per day without expending a spell slot. When you do this, you can choose to target one unwilling enemy creature and drop Concentration within the same turn. Such a target will have to make a Constitution save against your Spell DC or suffer the same consequences as if the natural end of a Haste spell occurred, without having gained any of the spell’s benefits.</p>",
