			"description": "<p>Until the spell ends, the target's Speed is doubled, it gains a +2 bonus to AC, it has advantage on Dexterity saving throws, and it gains one additional action on each of its turns. This action can be used to make a single weapon attack, or to take the Dash, Disengage, Hide, or Use an Object action.</p><p>When the spell ends, the target is tired and cannot move or take actions until after its next turn.</p>",
